# Working notes stay local. Named here, and the cost of naming them is
# accepted: this file is the only exclusion a clone carries, and
# `.git/info/exclude` is not cloned -- so moving these there left every
# fresh checkout one `git add -A` away from committing them, which is a
# worse thing to publish than the names.
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md
/.claude/
/docs/findings.md
/docs/audits.md
